# Cloudflare Pages security headers for the SPA (copied into dist/ by Vite).
# CSP connect-src allowlists the Cloud Run API host (VITE_API_BASE) by exact hostname, not a
# wildcard -- https://*.run.app would let the page connect to ANY Cloud Run service on the
# internet, not just ours. Two exact hosts are listed because this one Cloud Run service
# currently resolves under both its legacy alias (<service>-<hash>-<region-code>.a.run.app,
# what `gcloud run services describe` reports as status.url, and what deploy.yml's production
# build actually uses) and the modern format (<service>-<hash>.<region>.run.app, what PR
# previews build with via the API_PUBLIC_URL repo variable). If the API's Cloud Run URL,
# region, or either alias changes (or it moves to a custom origin), update this list in the
# same change as VITE_API_BASE.
# script-src allows static.cloudflareinsights.com to load the Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon,
# added manually in index.html (external <script src>, no inline body) rather than relying on
# Cloudflare's dashboard "automatic" injection -- that mode wraps the beacon in an inline
# script whose content (and therefore CSP hash) varies per page load, which a static
# allowlist can never match. The beacon then reports collected data to a DIFFERENT host,
# cloudflareinsights.com (no "static." prefix), hence the separate connect-src entry -- see
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/faq/. Keep both hosts in sync with the
# manual snippet in index.html if it's ever regenerated.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://caught-looking-oskfsj2ila-uc.a.run.app https://caught-looking-436925086053.us-central1.run.app https://cloudflareinsights.com; upgrade-insecure-requests
